DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
7447::$$$message_0052_0000_0000$$$::Nestled in a mountain, the gate to Ryudou Temple lies at the top of a long, stone stairway.[lr]::
7448::$$$message_0052_0000_0001$$$::It's guarded by a fickle gatekeeper. Not like the usual deva king or lion-dog statues, though...[lr]::
7449::$$$message_0052_0000_0002$$$::"He's here today."[lr]::
7450::$$$message_0052_0000_0003$$$::I spot Assassin, Sasaki Kojirou. I've never seen him in town, and lately, he hasn't even shown up much around the gate.::
7451::$$$message_0052_0001_0000$$$::Of course, he's dressed like this even when pilgrims come during the day. Definitely a suspicious character.[lr]::
7452::$$$message_0052_0001_0001$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]Fortunately for the visiting public, only people with spiritual senses can see him. I think.::
7453::$$$message_0052_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7454::$$$message_0052_0002_0001$$$::I just ended up here on one of my daily walks. I wonder why. Issei's at school on the weekends, too.[lr]::
7455::$$$message_0052_0002_0002$$$::I usually give him a forced, cheerful greeting, but I can't see me and Kojirou having a real conversation.[lr]::
7456::$$$message_0052_0002_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
7457::$$$message_0052_0002_0004$$$::Kojirou doesn't spare me more than a glance, either.[lr]::
7458::$$$message_0052_0002_0005$$$::Once he knows I'm not hostile, he looks past me.[lr]::
7459::$$$message_0052_0002_0006$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]Still...he's gotta be bored, standing here day in, day out.::
7460::$$$message_0052_0003_0000$$$::It's literally his job to do nothing[line len=2]Okay, that's an overstatement, but I can't imagine the utter tedium. I feel bad for him.::
7461::$$$message_0052_0004_0000$$$::"Maybe I'll bring him some refreshments next time..."[lr]::
7462::$$$message_0052_0004_0001$$$::He doesn't look like he'd turn down liquor. Should I bring him something from the temple cellar?::
7463::$$$message_0052_0005_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7464::$$$message_0052_0005_0001$$$::Kojirou abruptly stands up straight.[lr]::
7465::$$$message_0052_0005_0002$$$::I notice after him the sound of someone climbing the stone steps. The climber stops several times to catch their breath.[lr]::
7466::$$$message_0052_0005_0003$$$::I wonder who it is. I hide behind the gate and watch the stairs.[lr]::
7467::$$$message_0052_0005_0004$$$::Wait. There's no reason for me to hide. I just went with the flow.::
7468::$$$message_0052_0006_0000$$$::"Haah, haah, haah..."[lr]::
7469::$$$message_0052_0006_0001$$$::The climber rests again, a few steps away from the top. I recognize her face. It's Saegusa. Did she come alone?[lr]::
7470::$$$message_0052_0006_0002$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]She ascends the last few steps after she finally recovers her strength.::
7471::$$$message_0052_0007_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7472::$$$message_0052_0007_0001$$$::Kojirou stares at her quietly.[lr]::
7473::$$$message_0052_0007_0002$$$::Once she's past the stairs, Saegusa gives Kojirou a timid look. She hasn't noticed me.[lr]::
7474::$$$message_0052_0007_0003$$$::...She can see him.[lr]::
7475::$$$message_0052_0007_0004$$$::I think I heard about this before.::
7476::$$$message_0052_0008_0000$$$::"U-um..."[lr]::
7477::$$$message_0052_0008_0001$$$::Saegusa fearfully breaks the silence.[lr]::
7478::$$$message_0052_0008_0002$$$::I'd be scared, too. Some swordsman in a historical costume is just standing here without any TV crew or prank signboard around.::
7479::$$$message_0052_0009_0000$$$::"Excuse me...a-are you from the temple?"[lr]::
7480::$$$message_0052_0009_0001$$$::"...Indeed."::
7481::$$$message_0052_0010_0000$$$::"U-um, this might be rude of me to ask... [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01l(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01l(中) textoff=0]But is there a festival going on?"[lr]::
7482::$$$message_0052_0010_0001$$$::Straightforward. How very like Saegusa.[lr]::
7483::$$$message_0052_0010_0002$$$::She must be curious about his anachronistic clothing.::
7484::$$$message_0052_0011_0000$$$::"A festival...? I believe this temple does have such a history. [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01c(中) textoff=0]Caster said as much, though sadly, I know little else."[lr]::
7485::$$$message_0052_0011_0001$$$::   Saegusa tilts her head, bemused.::
7486::$$$message_0052_0012_0000$$$::"Huh.[lr]::
7487::$$$message_0052_0012_0001$$$::Caster is Mr. Kuzuki's wife...right?"[lr]::
7488::$$$message_0052_0012_0002$$$::"She is now. How vexing."[lr]::
7489::$$$message_0052_0012_0003$$$::His blunt replies throw Saegusa off even more.[lr]::
7490::$$$message_0052_0012_0004$$$::Thinking this might be a good time to mediate, I peek out from my hiding spot, but stop when I see how hard Saegusa is trying to keep Kojirou engaged. There's no room in this conversation for me.::
7491::$$$message_0052_0013_0000$$$::"I think Mrs. Caster and Mr. Kuzuki suit each other well, though... Um, what's your name?"[lr]::
7492::$$$message_0052_0013_0001$$$::"Kojirou Tsuda."[lr]::
7493::$$$message_0052_0013_0002$$$::"Do you think they suit each other, Kojirou?"[lr]::
7494::$$$message_0052_0013_0003$$$::Tsuda? Where'd you get that weird name from?[lr]::
7495::$$$message_0052_0013_0004$$$::Maybe he thinks that calling himself Sasaki while wearing that outfit would invite suspicion.::
7496::$$$message_0052_0014_0000$$$::"What is your name?"[lr]::
7497::$$$message_0052_0014_0001$$$::"Ah, [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01b(中) textoff=0]I'm Yukika Saegusa."[lr]::
7498::$$$message_0052_0014_0002$$$::"Then, Yukika Saegusa...the sight of that woman's envy when her husband's attention is elsewhere was one of my precious few pleasures, once. [cacheimage storage=小次郎03b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=小次郎03b(中) textoff=0]Lately, however, it's lost its luster."[lr]::
7499::$$$message_0052_0014_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01m(中)]That's...pretty spiteful, Kojirou.[lr]::
7500::$$$message_0052_0014_0004$$$::I can relate, though. He must not be very happy stuck on guard duty all day while Caster frolics around town.::
7501::$$$message_0052_0015_0000$$$::"Really..."[lr]::
7502::$$$message_0052_0015_0001$$$::"Oh, it's just an odd delight of mine. I'm sure she would be happy to have the blessing of an innocent girl like you."[lr]::
7503::$$$message_0052_0015_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=小次郎04b(中) textoff=0]Kojirou murmurs and sits down on the stairs.::
7504::$$$message_0052_0016_0000$$$::"I'm...innocent?"[lr]::
7505::$$$message_0052_0016_0001$$$::Kojirou's body language seems intended to shoo Saegusa away, but she sits down next to him, instead.::
7506::$$$message_0052_0017_0000$$$::"...?"[lr]::
7507::$$$message_0052_0017_0001$$$::"Um... Kojirou, I'm not i-imagining you, am I?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
7508::$$$message_0052_0017_0002$$$::Saegusa pokes at Kojirou's robes as she asks her question. The object of her curiosity doesn't seem to react, but I can tell it bothers him.::
7509::$$$message_0052_0018_0000$$$::"Maki and Kane say that there's no samurai at the temple gate. [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg time=200 storage=由紀香私服02b(近) textoff=0][move textoff=0 time=80 path=(386,153,255)(401,147,255)(424,150,255)(438,157,255)(443,152,255) storage=由紀香私服02b(近) accel=1 spline=1]But you're really here."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
7510::$$$message_0052_0018_0001$$$::"...They just came at the wrong time."[lr]::
7511::$$$message_0052_0018_0002$$$::Kojirou looks bewildered.[lr]::
7512::$$$message_0052_0018_0003$$$::Even he would find it hard to deny a puppy's curiosity.::
7513::$$$message_0052_0019_0000$$$::"Really? You were inside the whole time?"[lr]::
7514::$$$message_0052_0019_0001$$$::"No...I was on top of the gate. My job is to watch for unsavory characters hiding among the pilgrims."[lr]::
7515::$$$message_0052_0019_0002$$$::He isn't lying, but it isn't the whole truth, either.[lr]::
7516::$$$message_0052_0019_0003$$$::I'm sure he's hesitant to tell her all about Servants.::
7517::$$$message_0052_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, so that's why you're dressed like a samurai? [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02a(中) textoff=0]I was wondering if you were practicing for one of the festival shows."[lr]::
7518::$$$message_0052_0020_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
7519::$$$message_0052_0020_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02b(中) textoff=0]Aha. Kojirou looks like he's at a loss, while Saegusa smiles innocently.::
7520::$$$message_0052_0021_0000$$$::"That's amazing, Kojirou. You look like an actual samurai. Uh... [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02c(中) textoff=0]Is that longsword on your back real?"[lr]::
7521::$$$message_0052_0021_0001$$$::"...Its name is Bicchuu Aoe. It is over five shaku long."[lr]::
7522::$$$message_0052_0021_0002$$$::"Wah... Wawawawah..."[wm canskip=0]::
7523::$$$message_0052_0022_0000$$$::When she hears that it's a real sword, Saegusa jumps backward, babbling.[lr]::
7524::$$$message_0052_0022_0001$$$::...It's only to be expected. Anyone would be scared if a man carrying a real sword was in front of them. In fact, something's wrong with me for not reacting that way.::
7525::$$$message_0052_0023_0000$$$::"Haha, don't be afraid. I would not slay a helpless child."[lr]::
7526::$$$message_0052_0023_0001$$$::"But aren't you worried about the police?"[lr]::
7527::$$$message_0052_0023_0002$$$::"Temples have always been off-limits to local wardens. They are of no concern."[lr]::
7528::$$$message_0052_0023_0003$$$::What century are we talking about here?[lr]::
7529::$$$message_0052_0023_0004$$$::[move textoff=0 time=100 path=(571,89,255)(564,98,255)(557,84,255)(539,77,255)(527,84,255)(521,93,255)(509,75,255) storage=由紀香私服02i(中) accel=-2 spline=1]Still looking terrified, Saegusa works up her courage and sits down next to Kojirou again.[wm canskip=0][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02b(中) textoff=0]::
7530::$$$message_0052_0024_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7531::$$$message_0052_0024_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
7532::$$$message_0052_0024_0002$$$::There's no place for the conversation to resume from, but they seem to be getting along well enough.[lr]::
7533::$$$message_0052_0024_0003$$$::As I'm watching them from behind the gate... The sudden shame of peering in on their conversation makes me scratch my head in embarrassment.::
7534::$$$message_0052_0025_0000$$$::"Kojirou...um..."[lr]::
7535::$$$message_0052_0025_0001$$$::"What is it?"[lr]::
7536::$$$message_0052_0025_0002$$$::"If it's all right with you...er..."[lr]::
7537::$$$message_0052_0025_0003$$$::I'm getting anxious just listening to this.[lr]::
7538::$$$message_0052_0025_0004$$$::Saegusa's talking to a man all by herself![lr]::
7539::$$$message_0052_0025_0005$$$::I wonder what makes her so curious about Kojirou that she's being just a little bolder than usual. If Makidera were here, she'd be making a mess of things, no doubt.::
7540::$$$message_0052_0026_0000$$$::"I was wondering if you'd be willing to meet Maki and Kane..."[lr]::
7541::$$$message_0052_0026_0001$$$::"Your friends? Yes, I do recall seeing this Kane before."[lr]::
7542::$$$message_0052_0026_0002$$$::Kojirou nods, but his expression is stern.::
7543::$$$message_0052_0027_0000$$$::"Really? You've met Kane before?"[lr]::
7544::$$$message_0052_0027_0001$$$::"I simply happened to catch sight of her. I was up above the last time she came by.[lr]::
7545::$$$message_0052_0027_0002$$$::Is it truly a good idea, though, for your friends to meet a hermit such as me?"::
7546::$$$message_0052_0028_0000$$$::He lets out a light, theatrical sigh.[lr]::
7547::$$$message_0052_0028_0001$$$::It looks like he's taking advantage of Saegusa's naïveté to entertain himself.::
7548::$$$message_0052_0029_0000$$$::"Ah... I-I'm sorry. I didn't mean to bother you... You're right."[lr]::
7549::$$$message_0052_0029_0001$$$::Saegusa looks disappointed.[lr]::
7550::$$$message_0052_0029_0002$$$::It would take someone as pushy as Makidera or Tohsaka to get him to agree to that.::
7551::$$$message_0052_0030_0000$$$::"U-um!"[lr]::
7552::$$$message_0052_0030_0001$$$::"Yes, Lady Yukika?"[lr]::
7553::$$$message_0052_0030_0002$$$::"In that case, would you...be so kind as to meet my little brothers sometime?"::
7554::$$$message_0052_0031_0000$$$::"And why would I do that?"[lr]::
7555::$$$message_0052_0031_0001$$$::"I think they would be amazed to see a real live samurai. [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01j(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01j(中) textoff=0]If you'd be willing to make time for them, that is..."[lr]::
7556::$$$message_0052_0031_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01k(中) textoff=0]Saegusa trails off again.[lr]::
7557::$$$message_0052_0031_0003$$$::I'm sure she's trying her hardest.[lr]::
7558::$$$message_0052_0031_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=小次郎03b(中) textoff=0]   Kojirou smiles faintly at the invitation. There's no way she knows the weight of what she's asking him to commit to.::
7559::$$$message_0052_0032_0000$$$::"You have younger brothers, my lady?"[lr]::
7560::$$$message_0052_0032_0001$$$::"Yes. I'm the oldest."[lr]::
7561::$$$message_0052_0032_0002$$$::"I see. They must be kind and thoughtful, like their sister."[lr]::
7562::$$$message_0052_0032_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01c頬(中) textoff=0]Saegusa blushes bright red at Kojirou's compliment.[lr]::
7563::$$$message_0052_0032_0004$$$::[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4][chgfg time=200 pos=r storage=由紀香私服01l(中) textoff=0]She starts to panic again.::
7564::$$$message_0052_0033_0000$$$::"Th-that isn't true! [wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01n(近),由紀香私服02h(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=404 top=220 time=300 accel=0 storage=由紀香私服01n(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=411 top=240 time=300 accel=0 storage=由紀香私服02h(近)]They're naughty, they don't listen to me, they eat too much, they're always stirring up trouble, [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01d(近),由紀香私服02h(近),由紀香私服02d(近),小次郎03a(近)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=418 top=200 time=300 accel=0 storage=由紀香私服01d(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=459 top=199 time=300 accel=0 storage=由紀香私服02h(近)]and I bet they're going to say weird things to you and it oh gosh makes me so nervous I'm sorry, um!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 tops=207, fliplrs=,1 storages=由紀香私服02d(近),小次郎03a(近) time=300 flipudr=0 lefts=436, monos=,1 poss=,l colors=,0xFF5A5A5A indexes=1000,4000][move textoff=0 time=260 path=(431,219,255)(427,206,255)(425,219,255) storage=由紀香私服02d(近) accel=-2][wm canskip=0][lr]::
7565::$$$message_0052_0033_0001$$$::"There's no need for alarm, Lady Yukika. Yes, it may not be a terrible idea to share some old tales."::
7566::$$$message_0052_0034_0000$$$::Kojirou nods, once again amping up the dramatic flair.[lr]::
7567::$$$message_0052_0034_0001$$$::He's being evasive, but I didn't realize he was this socially adept[line len=2]or was this his genuine personality all along? If so, I've gravely underestimated Saegusa.::
7568::$$$message_0052_0035_0000$$$::"Really!?"[lr]::
7569::$$$message_0052_0035_0001$$$::"If the mood strikes me, I will reveal myself to them. But it is dangerous to visit at night. Bring them by during the day."[lr]::
7570::$$$message_0052_0035_0002$$$::"Th-then I'll come back again with my brothers another time! [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02b(中) textoff=0]Thank you and sorry again for asking all this!"[lr]::
7571::$$$message_0052_0035_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]She bows repeatedly.[lr]::
7572::$$$message_0052_0035_0004$$$::I missed my chance to make an exit...but all's well that ends well. Honestly, this is just eavesdropping. Kojirou probably knows I'm here, but it's rude to Saegusa.::
7573::$$$message_0052_0036_0000$$$::I leave the mountain gate as quietly as I can.[lr]::
7574::$$$message_0052_0036_0001$$$::"Guess I'll take a look around the temple grounds...":4